            "altText": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Horizontal bar chart of the inclusion funnel. The published dataset of about 930,000 films falls to 85,394 once the starter file keeps only films with a budget above zero, then to 79,222 released films, 56,072 with a release date, 28,193 with a credible budget, 10,219 that report revenue, and finally 7,733 with at least 50 ratings. On a linear scale the final bar is barely visible.'"
